BT /F2 14 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 439.0 Tm (3. Main Query Structure) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 417.0 Tm (The generated query uses common table expressions \(CTEs\). Each CTE represents one logical) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 404.0 Tm (stage of cohort construction.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 381.0 Tm (3.1 AllEvents) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 364.0 Tm (AllEvents normalizes diagnosis, laboratory, and medication records into one event stream.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 351.0 Tm (It gives each event common fields such as patient ID, domain, event date, code, name,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 338.0 Tm (numeric value, patient category, and age at event.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 317.0 Tm (WITH AllEvents AS \() Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 306.5 Tm (  SELECT OH_PID, 'diagnosis' AS DOMAIN, VISIT_DATE AS EVENT_DATE,) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 296.0 Tm (         ICD_CODE AS CODE, DISEASE_NAME AS NAME) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 285.5 Tm (  FROM Diagnosis) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 275.0 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 264.5 Tm (  UNION ALL) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 254.0 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 243.5 Tm (  SELECT OH_PID, 'lab', RESULT_DATE, LAB_CODE, LAB_NAME) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 233.0 Tm (  FROM Laboratory) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 222.5 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 212.0 Tm (  UNION ALL) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 201.5 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 191.0 Tm (  SELECT OH_PID, 'drug', ORDER_DATE, DRUG_CODE, DRUG_NAME) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 180.5 Tm (  FROM Medication) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 170.0 Tm (\)) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 148.5 Tm (3.2 IndexRule CTEs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 131.5 Tm (Each T0/index rule becomes an IndexRule CTE. The CTE selects distinct patients and event) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 118.5 Tm (dates that match the nested condition tree and the absolute T0 date window.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 100.5 Tm (For the diabetes example, the logic is equivalent to:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 79.5 Tm (IndexRule1 AS \() Tj ET
