BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 790.0 Tm (  WHERE DOMAIN = 'diagnosis') Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 779.5 Tm (    AND \(CODE = 'E11.9' OR CODE = 'E11.65' OR CODE = 'E11.22'\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 769.0 Tm (    AND EVENT_DATE BETWEEN '2023-01-01' AND '2025-12-31') Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 758.5 Tm (\)) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 737.0 Tm (3.3 IndexCohort) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 720.0 Tm (IndexCohort joins matching events to Patient_Info and assigns a T0 date to each eligible) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 707.0 Tm (patient. The current implementation uses the minimum matching event date as T0_DATE.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 686.0 Tm (IndexCohort AS \() Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 675.5 Tm (  SELECT p.OH_PID, MIN\(i.EVENT_DATE\) AS T0_DATE) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 665.0 Tm (  FROM Patient_Info p) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 654.5 Tm (  JOIN IndexRule1 i ON i.OH_PID = p.OH_PID) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 644.0 Tm (  GROUP BY p.OH_PID) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 633.5 Tm (\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 617.0 Tm (If there are multiple index rules, the query adds EXISTS checks for each rule and combines) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 604.0 Tm (them with the configured AND or OR joiners.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 581.0 Tm (3.4 BasePatients) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 564.0 Tm (BasePatients applies demographic criteria to the index cohort. It retains the patient) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 551.0 Tm (columns and the calculated T0 date.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 530.0 Tm (BasePatients AS \() Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 519.5 Tm (  SELECT p.*, i.T0_DATE) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 509.0 Tm (  FROM Patient_Info p) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 498.5 Tm (  JOIN IndexCohort i ON i.OH_PID = p.OH_PID) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 488.0 Tm (  WHERE DATEDIFF\(YEAR, p.BIRTH_DATE, GETDATE\(\)\) >= 18) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 477.5 Tm (\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 461.0 Tm (The supported demographic filters are minimum age, maximum age, and sex.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 438.0 Tm (3.5 Inclusion Criteria) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 421.0 Tm (Each inclusion rule becomes a correlated EXISTS subquery. The event must belong to the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 408.0 Tm (current patient, match the rule, and satisfy any timing window relative to T0_DATE.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 390.0 Tm (For example, the diabetes preset requires an HbA1c result within 180 days and metformin) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 377.0 Tm (within 90 days after T0:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 356.0 Tm (EXISTS \() Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 345.5 Tm (  SELECT 1 FROM AllEvents e) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 335.0 Tm (  WHERE e.OH_PID = p.OH_PID) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 324.5 Tm (    AND e.DOMAIN = 'lab') Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 314.0 Tm (    AND e.CODE = 'HBA1C') Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 303.5 Tm (    AND DATEDIFF\(DAY, p.T0_DATE, e.EVENT_DATE\) BETWEEN 0 AND 180) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 293.0 Tm (\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 282.5 Tm (AND EXISTS \() Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 272.0 Tm (  SELECT 1 FROM AllEvents e) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 261.5 Tm (  WHERE e.OH_PID = p.OH_PID) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 251.0 Tm (    AND e.DOMAIN = 'drug') Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 240.5 Tm (    AND e.CODE = 'MET500') Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 230.0 Tm (    AND DATEDIFF\(DAY, p.T0_DATE, e.EVENT_DATE\) BETWEEN 0 AND 90) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 219.5 Tm (\)) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 198.0 Tm (3.6 Exclusion Criteria) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 181.0 Tm (Exclusion rules are also EXISTS subqueries, but the combined expression is negated.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 168.0 Tm (Therefore, a patient is removed when any configured exclusion event is found by default.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 147.0 Tm (AND NOT EXISTS \() Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 136.5 Tm (  SELECT 1 FROM AllEvents e) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 126.0 Tm (  WHERE e.OH_PID = p.OH_PID) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 115.5 Tm (    AND e.DOMAIN = 'diagnosis') Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 105.0 Tm (    AND e.CODE = 'N18.3') Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 94.5 Tm (    AND DATEDIFF\(DAY, p.T0_DATE, e.EVENT_DATE\) BETWEEN -365 AND 0) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 84.0 Tm (\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 27.0 Tm (Cohort Lens - SQL Query Explanation) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 509.0 27.0 Tm (Page 2) Tj ET
