BT /F2 14 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 790.0 Tm (4. Feasibility Count Query) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 768.0 Tm (SQL Server mode wraps the CTEs in a single SELECT that produces staged attrition counts:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 747.0 Tm (SELECT) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 736.5 Tm (  \(SELECT COUNT\(*\) FROM Patient_Info\) AS totalPatients,) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 726.0 Tm (  \(SELECT COUNT\(*\) FROM IndexCohort\) AS indexEligibleCount,) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 715.5 Tm (  \(SELECT COUNT\(*\) FROM BasePatients\) AS demographicCount,) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 705.0 Tm (  \(...\) AS inclusionCount,) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60.0 694.5 Tm (  \(...\) AS finalCount) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 678.0 Tm (The values mean:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 660.0 Tm (- totalPatients: all rows in Patient_Info.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 645.0 Tm (- indexEligibleCount: patients with at least one matching T0 event.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 630.0 Tm (- demographicCount: T0 patients remaining after age and sex filters.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 615.0 Tm (- inclusionCount: demographic patients satisfying all inclusion logic.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 600.0 Tm (- finalCount: patients remaining after inclusion and exclusion logic.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 577.0 Tm (5. Operator Translation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 555.0 Tm (The condition builder translates filter types into SQL expressions:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 537.0 Tm (- Text: equality, inequality, LIKE, starts-with, ends-with, and empty checks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 522.0 Tm (- Numbers: equality, comparisons, ranges, and NULL checks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 507.0 Tm (- Dates: exact date, before/after, ranges, today, and this month.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 492.0 Tm (- Select fields: equality, IN, NOT IN, and empty checks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 477.0 Tm (- Days from T0: DATEDIFF\(DAY, p.T0_DATE, e.EVENT_DATE\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 462.0 Tm (Text values are quoted and apostrophes are escaped. Numeric values are converted before) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 449.0 Tm (being inserted into the SQL string. The query builder is still a draft string generator) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 436.0 Tm (rather than a parameterized production query.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 410.0 Tm (6. Other SQL Queries) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 388.0 Tm (The project has additional SQL outside the cohort count query:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 370.0 Tm (- Dictionary bootstrap queries aggregate code, name, group, and occurrence counts from) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 357.0 Tm (  Diagnosis, Laboratory, and Medication.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 342.0 Tm (- SQL Server app-storage queries manage users, sessions, OTPs, saved cohorts, audit) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 329.0 Tm (  sessions, and feasibility run logs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 314.0 Tm (- tests/sql-initial-setup.sql creates the clinical and application tables plus indexes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 301.0 Tm (  intended to support these queries.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 278.0 Tm (7. Important Limitations) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 256.0 Tm (- The generated SQL is a feasibility-study draft and should be reviewed before use) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 243.0 Tm (  against real clinical data.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 228.0 Tm (- SQL mode returns counts and attrition, not patient-level result rows.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 213.0 Tm (- Age uses GETDATE\(\) and BIRTH_DATE rather than an exact age-at-T0 calculation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 198.0 Tm (- When multiple T0 rules are matched, T0_DATE is currently the minimum matching event) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 185.0 Tm (  date.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 170.0 Tm (- The query targets the project's local guide schema, not OMOP CDM tables.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 155.0 Tm (Primary implementation files: src/sqlBuilder.js \(SQL generation\),) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 142.0 Tm (src/server/sqlServerFeasibilityRepository.js \(SQL Server execution\), src/cohortEngine.js) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 129.0 Tm (\(equivalent JSON evaluation\), and tests/sql-initial-setup.sql \(starter SQL schema\).) Tj ET
